 code insight.\n- FastAPI support (Pro): Visualize endpoint dependencies with interactive graphs that mark yield/return calls and detect circular dependencies.\n- Redesigned Python interpreter widget: Access and recreate environments organized around the tools that manage them (uv, Poetry, Hatch, and conda).\n- Deeper Pydantic support: Field constraint checks in the editor, direct navigation from @field_validator, and code completion for model configuration options.\nRead about all the key changes on our what's new page.\n\nFull release notes.","releaseNotesUrl":"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/articles/PY-A-233538649","tags":["code","coding","develop","development","django","programming","python"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"面向专业开发者的 Python IDE","documentations":[{"DocumentLabel":"学习 PyCharm","DocumentUrl":"https://www.jetbrains.com/zh-cn/pycharm/learn/"}],"license":"专有软件","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"Python 与 Django IDE，支持智能代码补全、实时错误检查和快速修复，等等…","packageUrl":"https://www.jetbrains.com/zh-cn/pycharm/","publisherSupportUrl":"https://www.jetbrains.com/zh-cn/support/","publisherUrl":"https://www.jetbrains.com/zh-cn/","purchaseUrl":"https://www.jetbrains.com/zh-cn/pycharm/buy/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/articles/PY-A-233538649","tags":["django","python","代码","开发","编程","集成开发环境"]}},"publisherSupportUrl":"https://www.jetbrains.com/support/","publisherUrl":"https://www.jetbrains.com/","releaseDate":"2026-11-05","releaseDateSource":"commit","releaseNotesUrl":"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/articles/PY-A-233538649","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"a4a78ef7dd5a1ec000e60392173b33bed55f7cbb","manifestVersion":"1.28.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/j/JetBrains/PyCharm/2026.3/JetBrains.PyCharm.installer.yaml","sha256":"7cb3494d890fcd3db988f26e1ac6646c806df6f947b705f9b0e1aaaea54925d0"},{"path":"manifests/j/JetBrains/PyCharm/2026.3/JetBrains.PyCharm.locale.en-US.yaml","sha256":"eba9963d63c77e6aad6f41fc6c3d1b618e1dadf7698d83cfc9a